<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{!product}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">这条资料不在当前快照中</view><view class="muted">链接可能无效，或详情尚未收录。</view><button bindtap="back">返回</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="eyebrow">{{product.brandLabel}} / 来源记录</view><view class="title detail-title">{{product.name}}</view><view class="badge">来源报告 · 非厂家认证</view>
    <view class="photo-card"><image wx:if="{{product.imagePath && !imageFailed}}" class="product-photo" src="{{product.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="imageError" aria-label="{{product.name}} 的来源主图"/><view wx:else class="photo-placeholder"><view class="placeholder-mark">▤</view><view>{{imageFailed ? '本地原图暂无法显示' : '实际产品图片未采集'}}</view><view class="small muted">{{imageFailed ? '保留原始文件，未转码或替换' : '不使用模拟包装图或网络占位图'}}</view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{product.imagePath}}" class="small muted">来源实际主图 · 保留原水印 · 仅作资料识别，不作真伪鉴定。</view>
    <view class="health">吸烟有害健康。低焦油不代表低危害。下列数值是来源站点记录，不是本项目实测。</view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">基础资料</view><view class="card spec-card"><view wx:for="{{product.fields}}" wx:key="key" class="spec-row"><text class="spec-label">{{item.label}}</text><view class="spec-value"><view class="{{item.present ? '' : 'unknown'}}">{{item.value}}</view><view class="field-note">{{item.note}}</view></view></view></view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">规格记录</view><view class="card spec-card"><view wx:for="{{product.measurements}}" wx:key="key" class="spec-row"><text class="spec-label">{{item.label}}</text><view class="spec-value"><view class="{{item.present ? '' : 'unknown'}}">{{item.value}}<text wx:if="{{item.unit}}" class="unit"> {{item.unit}}</text></view><view class="field-note">{{item.note}}</view></view></view></view><view class="note">「待核验」表示来源有数值图，但尚未转录；「未采集」表示当前来源快照未提供。空值不等于 0。</view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">条码记录</view><view class="card spec-card"><view wx:for="{{product.barcodes}}" wx:key="key" class="barcode-row"><view class="small muted">{{item.label}}</view><text class="barcode-value {{item.present ? '' : 'unknown'}}" selectable="{{true}}">{{item.value}}</text><view class="field-note">{{item.note}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{product.hasMultiplePackBarcodes}}" class="warning">来源列出多个小盒条码，尚未确定主版本；并列保留，不据此推断批次、真伪或可售状态。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{product.evidence.length > 0}}" class="section"><button class="evidence-toggle" bindtap="toggleEvidence">{{evidenceOpen ? '收起' : '查看'}} {{product.evidence.length}} 张规格原图证据 {{evidenceOpen ? '−' : '+'}}</button><view wx:if="{{evidenceOpen}}" class="card"><view class="small muted">下图为实际保存的来源数值/条码图片，未重新绘制。读图只确认来源显示内容，不是对产品实测值或真伪的认证。</view><view wx:for="{{product.evidence}}" wx:key="sha256" class="evidence-row"><view class="small">{{item.label}}</view><image wx:if="{{!failedEvidence[item.sha256]}}" src="{{item.path}}" style="width: {{item.displayWidth}}rpx; height: {{item.displayHeight}}rpx;" mode="aspectFit" binderror="evidenceError" data-key="{{item.sha256}}"/><view wx:else class="small muted">原图暂无法显示</view><view class="field-note">人工核读日期 {{item.reviewDate}}</view></view></view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">来源与边界</view><view class="card"><view class="source-line">来源：烟悦网 · 用户贡献百科</view><view class="source-line">采集时间：{{product.observedAt}}</view><text class="source-line break" selectable="{{true}}">来源页面：{{product.sourceUrl}}</text><view class="note">品牌归属来自已保存的品牌目录列表关系，不以产品名称猜测。包装文字、数值与条码可能随地区或时间变化，当前记录不表示仍在生产或可销售。</view><view class="note">宣传性原文介绍暂不展示；图片集、全部规格与其他产品资料仍不完整。</view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{storageError}}" class="warning">本地收藏存储暂不可用，本次变更未确认保存；不会向服务器上传。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="toggleFavorite">{{favorite ? '取消本地收藏' : '收藏资料'}}</button><view class="footer">仅本机书签，不构成推荐</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="openAbout">了解字段核验与授权说明 →</button>
  </block>
</view>
